ot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-04, when Dave asked what he works on to relax, Calvin shared a photo of a shiny orange car with its hood open and said he loves working on this project \"to chill out\" (a car project Calvin is working on himself — distinct from his own Ferrari, see ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26); makes sense given his long-standing finding that working on/fixing cars relaxes him \"like meditation,\" see the 2023-05-31 entry in ## Relationships) [S21T3].\n- On 2023-10-15, when Dave (feeling discouraged after his shop lost a deal to a competitor) asked how he stays motivated when faced with setbacks: \"When setbacks come my way, I remind myself why I'm passionate about my goals. I rely on helpful people around me and take a break to recharge with my favorite activities. That always helps me get back to feeling motivated.\" (complements his earlier 2023-07-21 answer about staying motivated, see above) [S23T3][S23T4].\n- On 2023-10-15, said performing with Frank Ocean \"recently has been really cool\" — said while reacting to Dave's music-festival story (see ## Relationships); the Frank Ocean tour he described to Dave on 2023-08-14 as having ended with the Tokyo show predates this remark, which suggests more recent performing with Frank Ocean (details in ## Frank Ocean collaboration; confirmed on 2023-10-19, when he told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean — see ## Frank Ocean collaboration) [S23T10].\n- On 2023-10-23, on the balance and pressure of touring/fame (complementing his earlier motivation answers, see above): the tour is incredible and energizing, but fame has its own challenges — balancing it all has been tough; he takes it one day at a time, it can get overwhelming with so many demands, but he enjoys what he does so he pushes on; a strong support system is a key strategy — his friends and team keep him on track [S25T2][S25T4][S25T6].\n- On 2023-10-23, when Dave asked (after Dave shared his good conversation with neighbors about current events and politics) how he stays informed and inspired: staying connected and up-to-date on world events is important to him — it helps his music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives, connects him better with his fans, and keeps him motivated and inspired [S25T8].","text_sha256":"18efab7aa0e4325cff5b08095bcef6b5967d495bbd419c5ca77c1bf66ffeb2d4","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D14:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":126,"line_start":126,"source_locators":["[S14T8]"],"text_sha256":"2b665cfc8ba85a91fef79e15593ebae8d95b6bd081cc529d7e1c0b09b1b4fa6b"},{"dia_ids":["D14:10"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":127,"line_start":127,"source_locators":["[S14T10]"],"text_sha256":"32b66365a5fcafbf582df8671b1f2542329fd3de5f775b7bd0a73f2ef184975f"},{"dia_ids":["D15:2","D15:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":128,"line_start":128,"source_locators":["[S15T2]","[S15T4]"],"text_sha256":"521ec185f4385ea5a43c08d0056d31496c2d39236bd0ea60045a160a7686c26b"},{"dia_ids":["D15:10"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":129,"line_start":129,"source_locators":["[S15T10]"],"text_sha256":"94e961a79dd1b2a80157e3fb8aafd40d988926d3f686dd8122eaf5b9cf95a606"},{"dia_ids":["D16:24"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":130,"line_start":130,"source_locators":["[S16T24]"],"text_sha256":"53876567df67844f6c6455ec4378e94b9e32c807b7457aa5d813283c34d25f66"},{"dia_ids":["D18:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":131,"line_start":131,"source_locators":["[S18T1]"],"text_sha256":"2009612325acf87d3dc314d35332959a13db1b898e134ec1d584701cfe079ed3"}],"dia_ids":["D14:8","D14:10","D15:2","D15:4","D15:10","D16:24","D18:1"],"evidence_id":"ev-b0035e95ab4ec237a0c0e09e232579412777909587c12a67a174cd0f3bbbf957","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_end":131,"line_start":126,"observation_ids":["obs-0001"],"path":"/memories/c