he show, shared a photo from the tour's closing show in Tokyo (details in ## Tokyo trip (2023-04-20)): a crowd of people at the concert with their hands up — \"It was so awesome - I loved how the crowd was into it. These moments are why I love my job.\" [S14T8].\n- On 2023-08-14, said the tour's closing show was \"buzzing\" — \"It's moments like these that make me so proud and motivated\" — and that he's \"all about spreading joy with my art\" [S14T10].\n- As of 2023-08-22, scored a deal to continue collaborating with Frank Ocean and recorded a song in the studio at his mansion (details in ## Frank Ocean collaboration) [S15T2][S15T4].\n- On 2023-08-22, when Dave asked if any other collaborations came out of the performance, said someone noticed his performance and now they're working together — \"which is wild\"; the collaborator's identity is not specified (a new collaborator besides Frank Ocean, or Frank Ocean himself — unconfirmed) [S15T10].\n- On 2023-08-31 (octopus-guitar chat, see ## Octopus guitar), after Dave said his unique style really stands out in his music and playing, Calvin said he's glad Dave appreciates it: trying to stay true to himself and be unique in his music is something he values [S16T24].\n- On 2023-09-13, told Dave his album finally dropped on 2023-09-11 (\"the 11th\" as of 2023-09-13) — it was \"a wild feeling\"; everyone's been loving it, and it's motivated him to keep going [S18T1].","text_sha256":"866ffe9e0c62b2f742cd0e91e3576cfdbbebdf52a966641b04758f37a89620e9","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D15:2"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":65,"line_start":65,"source_locators":["[S15T2]"],"text_sha256":"2e380856fc9b76991957d16dd168f7962484e6a4fe1002750890ed66d1379d81"},{"dia_ids":["D15:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":66,"line_start":66,"source_locators":["[S15T4]"],"text_sha256":"7a49bab9ba0bacfb97d02766a257553cb2a98c76189c96