2022) when he and Frank Ocean met at a festival and Frank said he wanted to collaborate — \"We clicked right away and the chemistry on stage was incredible. I'm so lucky!\" This is a later, more specific account than the 2023-08-22 one (a Tokyo music festival, possibly the one he attended on 2023-04-20 — see ## Tokyo trip (2023-04-20)); the two accounts differ on when/where they met (August 2022 festival vs. a 2023 Tokyo festival) — both kept. [S24T5]\n- On 2023-10-19, shared photos while telling Dave about the tour: of how he performed on stage (a photo of a band performing on stage with bright lights — \"that was awesome!\"), of him and Frank Ocean together on stage (a photo of a band performing on stage with a projection of a man on the wall — \"we perfectly look together on stage\"), and of the audience (a photo of a large crowd of people in a large auditorium — \"Look at this crowd, that was insane!\") [S24T1][S24T5][S24T7].","text_sha256":"7b1677113c2b3a49c0a4b02f09c78c8e864a04fc6116e2c14538bac984be6e67","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":344,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":9114,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":9458},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"60d0c608bdda6e13c46a9e6cbf4cd7cae4f7eea8d7fcd2d8a4f8f9bde415df7c","filesystem_tools_sha256":"1632a476feccd761a1c6d21c9d2962d0975632f50d6c96678d69427a7f973ed7","orchestration_actions_sha256":"115512fb955e8c7fca557e4b995c5bfd8717ca72dfb184810b04343bc595cd08","paper_prompt_id":"refind-stage1-plus-r3-curated-adapter-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea29707